      "message": "[error] Line 3851: 🔴 The Feed restrictions are not enforced on the call path: `call()` accepts any loaded conversation and can invoke `hostConference()` for a subscriber. This lets a Feed subscriber create a conference even though the stated policy forbids subscribers from starting calls; the subsequent call-history commit is merely rejected by `feedAllows()`, after the conference has already been created. Reject Feed calls for non-owners before creating or routing the conference, and apply the same guard to direct hosting/incoming-call paths.",
