      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 1983: 🔴 The merge validation only prevents a closed policy from becoming open. `resolveConflicts()` selects an entire `profile.vcf` from one parent based on commit ID when both parents are open, so a concurrent owner-device merge can restore stale `feedAccess` (for example, one device revokes Bob while an offline device edits the title from the pre-revocation state). The merged policy then passes this check and Bob is authorized again. Merge Feed policy fields monotonically, or reject/validate policy conflicts against both parents instead of checking only `closed`.",
      "revId": "ba9d2fa984e8109a918cfbefc0f72ba3d56c5a03",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
